Notolog Editor for Debian
=========================

This is the Debian package for Notolog Editor - an open-source Markdown editor with integrated AI assistant features.

Official website: https://notolog.com
Online documentation: https://notolog.app
Upstream project: https://github.com/notolog/notolog-editor

Package Notes
-------------

- The binary is installed at: /usr/bin/notolog
- The PyInstaller one-file runtime is extracted to a temporary directory while the application runs.
- Documentation and licenses are located in: /usr/share/doc/notolog/

Runtime Behavior
----------------

- The application will create a per-user config directory at first launch, typically ~/.config/Notolog.
- Temporary runtime files are managed by PyInstaller and removed after a normal exit.

